<title>USA: Dawson Cty, Mont., won by D.A. Davidson.</title>
<headline>Dawson Cty, Mont., won by D.A. Davidson.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>D.A. Davidson said it won $4.166 million of Dawson Cty, Mont., general obligation bonds, Series 1996, with a net interest cost of 5.17 percent.</p>
</text>
